OL,3,ABurberry closes London Fashion Week
OL,4,A2026 with signature check print and
OL,5,Aceleb-filled front row
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurberry closed London Fashion Week on
OL,8,FMonday evening, with the British
OL,9,Ffashion house's chief designer Daniel
OL,10,FLee pairing their signature check print
OL,11,Fwith clashing florals and soft leather.
OL,13,FThe show was put together with the help
OL,14,Fof textile designer Celia Birtwell, who
OL,15,Fhand-painted some of the runway
OL,16,Fdesigns, including check print trenches
OL,17,Fand smiley-face emblazoned jumpers.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
